    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns7xO2wD",
      "title": "Add skUSD (Staked Kerne Synthetic Dollar) on Base",
      "author": "enerzy17",
      "number": 1337,
      "body": "Adds skUSD, the staked form of kUSD, a standard ERC-4626 vault native to Base (chain 8453).\n\n- Native token, not bridged: `nobridge: true`, `tokens.base` only.\n- On-chain metadata matches the contract: name \"Staked Kerne Synthetic Dollar\", symbol skUSD, 24 decimals.\n- Address: 0x96F5102C15b839757f811A98CEc3725Ac21DfA14 (source-verified on BaseScan and Sourcify).\n- Underlying asset is kUSD (0x5C2EfdF0D8D286959b42308966bc2B97f5680AA3).\n- DefiLlama: https://defillama.com/protocol/kerne\n- Logo: data/skUSD/logo.svg (SVG, 450x450).\n\nEarly stage; first external audit (Hexens) in progress, not yet complete. Admin keys not yet renounced.",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-13T19:30:15Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 28,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns7xO2o7",
      "title": "Add kUSD (Kerne Synthetic Dollar) on Base",
      "author": "enerzy17",
      "number": 1336,
      "body": "Adds kUSD, a native Base (chain 8453) yield-bearing synthetic dollar.\n\n- Native token, not bridged: `nobridge: true`, `tokens.base` only.\n- On-chain metadata matches the contract: name \"Kerne Synthetic Dollar\", symbol kUSD, 18 decimals.\n- Address: 0x5C2EfdF0D8D286959b42308966bc2B97f5680AA3 (source-verified on BaseScan and Sourcify).\n- DefiLlama: https://defillama.com/protocol/kerne\n- Logo: data/kUSD/logo.svg (SVG, 450x450).\n\nBacking is 1:1 USDC via a Peg Stability Module with an EIP-191 signed hourly proof of reserves; anyone can recompute it at https://kerne.fi/verify-anything . The protocol is early stage and its first external audit (Hexens) is in progress, not yet complete.",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-13T19:30:11Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 28,
